        "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:23:31.162Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Will we be able to access the VM befor the oppe exam starts, just to ensure everything works fine and also there was a warning for tab switch in the previous OPPE’s of other course so are we allowed to switch tabs.As i did all my BPT’s and NPPE’s on my windows powershell so are we allowed to do so</p>",
