        "created_at": "2025-08-11T10:35:04.853Z",
        "cooked": "<p>VM will be accessible 1 hour before the exam. You can ssh into it at 6:00 pm.<br>\nYou will be allowed to switch tabs between your terminal (powershell) and the exam tab. Opening anything else is not allowed.<br>\nYes, it’s the same as you did BPTs and NPPEs.</p>",
